<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">&nbsp;</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">We have received the funds to settlement agreement (add in vehicle or asset number or agreement number) and this has now been processed.</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">&nbsp;</span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Please find attached your settlement invoice.&nbsp;</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Please also find attached your rebate of rental invoice which I have set to be taken in 2 weeks via direct debit. Once we have received the funds for this invoice, we will be able to remove our financial interest from HPI.</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif">Please can you forward the sale of vehicle invoice for the above agreement. Until received, the agreement will move into its secondary period for which you will be charged an annual fee.</span></span><br />
<br />
